[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added to [38;5;153mindex.html:8-32[39m: a task list where each item is a [38;5;153m<label>[39m wrapping a native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m plus its
  text.

  - On/off state is the browser's native checkbox state — no JavaScript.
  - Wrapping in [38;5;153m<label>[39m makes the text clickable and gives the accessible name for free.
  - One CSS rule strikes through the text when checked, so "done" is visible.
  - Two placeholder items are there to show the pattern; swap them for real content.

  Not included (say the word if you want any): persistence across reloads, add/remove items, or a done counter. No tests
  were run — the repo has no test setup, and this is static markup.

